<contentList>
	<content contentuid="h734ab279gfdf3g2bf6gfe31g1ceafec615e0" version="1">Fireball Jutsu</content>
	<content contentuid="h694401a7g9adag4a76gc386g74170f3d80f6" version="1">Spit a great orb of flame that explodes on impact, scorching everything in its radius.</content>
	<content contentuid="h65e7acacgdfc1gb161g27aag2905b95fffdc" version="1">Water Dragon Jutsu</content>
	<content contentuid="h514138bcgee4cg6684gae54g44364df181a5" version="1">Shape chakra into a dragon of water that crashes into the target and drenches it.</content>
	<content contentuid="h37fda7f5geebag0310g7d46g0226c9ab6358" version="1">Lightning Cutter</content>
	<content contentuid="h78f11df6g2b41g6ae6g74a6g84ed1e52582f" version="1">Focus lightning chakra in your hand and dash through the target in an instant.</content>
	<content contentuid="h375b35f9g9badgedb3g465bgc0f1a8aa96cf" version="1">Wind Breakthrough</content>
	<content contentuid="h3e039cb2g4364g6b60ge134gd652f06177e0" version="1">Take a deep breath and blast a gale of wind that pushes enemies back.</content>
	<content contentuid="h7b38b0c0g8824gb959g41c5gfdf0d818ab94" version="1">Earth Spear</content>
	<content contentuid="h6814a784g5fa0g904egd930g8de8319e27fd" version="1">Raise sharp stone spears from the earth to impale your foes.</content>
